      "title": "JK Lakshmi Cement Limited (BSE:500380) entered into Share Purchase Agreement to acquire 77.96% stake in Necem Cements Ltd for INR 190 million.",
      "body": "JK Lakshmi Cement Limited (BSE:500380) entered into Share Purchase Agreement to acquire 77.96% stake in Necem Cements Ltd for INR 190 million on March 12, 2026. A cash consideration of INR 190 million will be paid by JK Lakshmi Cement Limited and also takeover of certain past liabilities of Necem Cements Ltd.\n\nFor the period ending March 31, 2025, Necem Cements Ltd reported total revenue of INR 15.6 million and net loss of INR 45.9 million. As of March 31, 2025, Necem Cements Ltd reported total assets of INR 113.1 million.\n\nThe transaction has been approved by the Committee of Directors of JK Lakshmi Cement Limited. The expected completion of the transaction is March 31, 2026.",
